      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you provide a summary of the primary legal-philosophical debate regarding the Second Amendment, specifically comparing the originalist and living constitutionalist interpretations? I'm looking for the core arguments each side uses to justify their readings of the text.",
      "source": "evaluator"
